# Feature-sized commits (portfolio)

Global policy lives at `~/.cursor/rules/feature-sized-commits.mdc` (also Cursor User Rules, `~/.codex/AGENTS.md`, `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`). Do not fork a second full copy here.

## Dev server (portfolio only)

Vite on `:9999` is meant to run via **macOS launchd** (`KeepAlive`), not inside Cursor agent shells — those get aborted and kill the server.

- Start / keep alive: `npm run dev:keep`
- Status: `npm run dev:status`
- Stop: `npm run dev:stop`

If the site is down, run `npm run dev:keep` — do **not** start `npm run dev` in a disposable agent background shell.
